Z||000000||Neverfinished||01-19-2001||08:54 PM||||Hey fiero fiends. Finally after about 2 months I finally registered to the forum. I Just wanted to thank everyone here for their knowledge that I've been using everyday. A little about my car; I own an 1984 SE 2.5 with 120,000 kilometers. I've put alot of time and money into my baby and probably spend more time on it that I do with my girlfriend. I've painted it a deep amethyst purple and put on some 16 inch wheels off a 92 grand am (white). I also believe to have the only spoiler off a mustang. Except for the new style mustang. I ripped it off a 91 cobra I believe and after a little careful modification and fiberglassing, I have thee most beautiful spoiler on any fiero out there. Well at least the cheapest since the guy at the auto wreckers just gave it to me. I have a beige interior and short shifter. I've put in a 700 watt sony amp with a clarion head unit and 4x10 kenwoods with the speakers in the seats also. Stimpy, I would like to get a hold of you to get info on your floor sub. Sorry this msg is long. I would like to see some pics of unusual spoilers if you guys have any because I have never seen a cobra spoiler on any fiero other than mine. <P>Look forward to getting some feedback. I'll get some pics scanned of my baby tonite and put them on.  <BR>See ya<BR>||||reg||14
