Z||000004||stimpy||01-19-2001||10:30 PM||||Welcome to the forum. Regarding the sub, I have an email saved that I can send you that gives you the basic idea on how to do it. Email me and I'll send it on to you.<P>Phil, you can use WebTV to post pics on the forum. You just can't use the PIP to hold your images. Don't fear, just store your images on Photopoint, and store your Photopoint album in Favorites. When you have a thread you want to post on, go to favorites, find your image (click til you get the black background) then hit your "go to" key. Arrow down to "show current and click. It will show the location of the pic you are looking at. Hit "cmd"A to highlight the address, then hit "cmd"C to copy. You'll hear a click. Then hit "Recent" to go back to your thread and use the <BR>"[ img ][ /img ]" tags(without extra spaces in the brackets) on either side of your cursor, then hit "cmd"V to paste the location of your image.<P>Sorry about the long off-topic ramble.<P>||||reg||14
